  <running_head>PHYSICARUM LIB. VIII.</running_head>
  <bottom_margin>
    <signature>S</signature>
  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">Non autem licet exinde de naturali</l>
    <l n="2">ejus officio judicare.</l>
    <l n="3" type="heading" level="2" para="true">XXI. <i>Porro renes superfluum ferum</i>
    </l>
    <l n="4" type="heading" level="2">
      <i>a sanguine seperant, atque ad vesicam</i>
    </l>
    <l n="5" type="heading" level="2">
      <i>transmittunt, a qua debite expurgatur.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="6" para="true">§. Renum officium satis plane con-</l>
    <l n="7">stat: verum qua ratione id expediatur,</l>
    <l n="8">aliquantum obscurius videtur. Planis-</l>
    <l n="9">sima ea explicandi ratio videtur esse,</l>
    <l n="10">quasi destillatione quadam per calo-</l>
    <l n="11">rem renum in pelvim ipsius transferri,</l>
    <l n="12">ex qua partim fluiditate sua, partim</l>
    <l n="13">virtute expultrice id per ureteres in ve-</l>
    <l n="14">sicam amandetur: in qua copia aliqua</l>
    <l n="15">collectum virtute expultrice (quæ con-</l>
    <l n="16">tractione vesicæ peragitur) commoda</l>
    <l n="17">via excernitur. At <i>quomodo serum ad</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18">
      <i>renes transfertur?</i> Primum pulsione per</l>
    <l n="19">arterias, &amp; deinde propria virtute at-</l>
    <l n="20">tractiva renum, sicuti videntur aliqua</l>
    <l n="21">ejus symptomata declarare.</l>
    <l n="22" type="heading" level="2" para="true">XXII. <i>Vesicula etiam fellis bilio-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="23" type="heading" level="2">
      <i>sum excrementum ab hepate exceptum</i>
    </l>
    <l n="24" type="heading" level="2">
      <i>aliquamdiu retinet, postea per peculiarem</i>
    </l>
    <l n="25" type="heading" level="2">
      <i>ductum exonerat.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="26" para="true">§. 1. Arbitrantur equidem aliqui</l>
    <l n="27">bilem statim ex chylo in hepate elabo-</l>
    <l n="28">rari, at nobis probabilius videtur ex</l>
    <l n="29">sanguine eandem adductione in corde</l>
    <l n="30">produci, verum ab hepate in vesicam fel-</l>
  </main_text>
  <notes />
</page>
